ponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Cindersnap_Reflexes\"> Condition: Cindersnap Reflexes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cindersnap_Reflexes_(Condition)\" title=\"Cindersnap Reflexes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cindersnap Reflexes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cindersnap_Reflexes_(Condition)\" title=\"Cindersnap Reflexes (Condition)\">Cindersnap Reflexes</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ranged_Attack\" title=\"Ranged Attack\">Ranged weapon attacks</a> targeting this entity have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> and their damage is halved.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield\" title=\"Abdel's Trusted Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield\" title=\"Abdel's Trusted Shield\">Abdel's Trusted Shield</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cindersnap_Gloves\" title=\"Cindersnap Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cindersnap_Gloves\" title=\"Cindersnap Gloves\">Cindersnap Gloves</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The damage reduction is distinct from <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> and stacks in a manner where multiple instances are applied sequentially (multiplicatively); each effect modifies the result of the previous one with it. For example, with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Missiles\" title=\"Protection from Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp/20px-Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp/20px-Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Protection_from_Missiles_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Protection from Missiles</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> resistance, arrows will deal one quarter damage. Usually such damage reduction is impossible since resistances cannot stack with each other.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cindersnap_Reflexes_(Condition)\" title=\"Cindersnap Reflexes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cindersnap Reflexes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Protection_from_Missiles_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cindersnap_Reflexes_(Condition)\" title=\"Cindersnap Reflexes (Condition)\">Cindersnap Reflexes</a> incorrectly says the target is only protected against the next ranged attack. They will be protected by all ranged attacks while the spell is active.\n<ul><li>Attacks from off-hand <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\">Hand Crossbows</a> are <i>not</i> affected by Protection from Missiles.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Protection_from_arrows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWik